#Staging api workflow:
POST /api/staging
       ↓
Check login
       ↓
Read originalImage
       ↓
Calculate cost
       ↓
Check user's credits
       ↓
Call MuAPI
       ↓
Wait for result
       ↓
Did staging succeed?
       ↓
      YES
       ↓
Prisma transaction
       ↓
Create Project
       ↓
Create ORIGINAL_IMAGE Asset
       ↓
Create GENERATED_IMAGE Asset
       ↓
Create GenerationJob
       ↓
Deduct User.credits
       ↓
Create CreditTransaction
       ↓
Return images + credits

#After staging completed --> navbar credit
Staging completed
       ↓
POST /api/user/credits
       ↓
Database: 10 → 4
       ↓
API returns { credits: 4 }
       ↓
setCredits(4)       ← staging page
       ↓
dispatch "credits-updated"
       ↓
Navbar hears event
       ↓
GET /api/user/credits
       ↓
Database says 4
       ↓
Navbar displays 🪙 4
